<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>每日视界</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .nav {
            background-color: #333;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .nav a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }
        .nav a:hover {
            color: #ccc;
        }
        .main {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .article {
            background-color: #f7f7f7;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px;
            width: calc(33.33% - 20px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .article h2 {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .article p {
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            clear: both;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>每日视界</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="nav">
        <a href="index.html">首页</a>
        <a href="finance.html">财经</a>
        <a href="tech.html">科技</a>
        <a href="about.html">关于我们</a>
    </div>
    <div class="main">
        <div class="article">
            <h2>国家发改委：今年将继续推进高水平对外开放</h2>
            <p>近日，国家发展改革委副主任赵辰杰表示，今年将继续推进高水平对外开放，进一步扩大市场准入，深化投资领域审批制度改革。</p>
            <a href="article1.html">阅读全文</a>
        </div>
        <div class="article">
            <h2>小米发布新款智能手机</h2>
            <p>昨日，小米公司发布了新款智能手机，配备了最新的处理器和摄像头技术。</p>
            <a href="article2.html">阅读全文</a>
        </div>
        <div class="article">
            <h2>全国人大常委会通过新环境保护法</h2>
            <p>昨日，全国人大常委会通过了新的环境保护法，旨在进一步加强环境保护力度。</p>
            <a href="article3.html">阅读全文</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2023 每日视界</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

